Z||000003||JetroGT||09-15-1999||02:19 PM||||The Aldino that I took pictures of was red with a 3.8 Supercharged Buick in it. <BR>V8 Archie brought his blue chop top GT to the show. He did a pretty good job, but the windows don't seem to close quite right.||||reg||1
